  {
   "kind": "tool",
   "t": 7.712,
   "text": "Read install.ps1",
   "turn": 0,
   "diff": null
  },
  {
   "kind": "reply",
   "t": 9.062,
   "text": "It sets up Talkover in one go. It builds a Python virtual environment with the right packages, then uses Docker to start two speech engines: Whisper to turn your speech into text, and Kokoro to read replies out loud. It downloads the Whisper model too. Next it adds Talkover's hooks to your Claude Code settings file. If you ask for them, it can also use your GPU, start Talkover when you log in, and add a listener for the word \"stop\". It ends with a health check.",
   "turn": 0,
   "think_from": 7.012
  },
